      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹54.97 (up from ₹40.68 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹82.7b (up 4.8% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹8.08b (up 35% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.8% (up from 7.6% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 19% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 3% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
